  "question": {
    "text": "The set of values of $\\theta$ satisfying the inequation $2 \\sin ^2 \\theta-5 \\sin \\theta+2>0$, where $0 < \\theta < 2 \\pi$, is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "5BT5m",
      "text": "\n$\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\cup\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{6}, 2 \\pi\\right)$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "xAO6q",
      "text": "\n$\\left[0, \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right] \\cup\\left[\\frac{5 \\pi}{6}, 2 \\pi\\right]$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "eW2aV",
      "text": "\n$\\left[0, \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right] \\cup\\left[\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}, 2 \\pi\\right]$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHHb8",
      "text": "\nNone of these",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { As, } 2 \\sin ^2 \\theta-5 \\sin \\theta+2>0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow(2 \\sin \\theta-1)(\\sin \\theta-2)>0 \\\\\n& \\quad[\\text { where, }(\\sin \\theta-2) < 0 \\text { for all } \\theta \\in R] \\\\\n& \\therefore \\quad(2 \\sin \\theta-1) < 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/SKUf5eaj68_7yEgcuBmEhMZj9ZevTUY2gjOCmj2PQDY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$$\n\\begin{array}{ll}\n\\Rightarrow & \\sin \\theta < \\frac{1}{2}, \\text { shown as } \\\\\n\\therefore & \\theta \\in\\left(0, \\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\cup\\left(\\frac{5 \\pi}{6}, 2 \\pi\\right)\n\\end{array}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
